# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Lord Aliden Perenolde (507), Taretha's Gift (508), Ward Restocking (92519),
# WANTED: Baron Vardus (566).

# Alterac and the second Arathi visit at 38-39 (the 2026-11-07 re-order): Strahnbrad, the
# Perenolde manor and the Dalaran ruins from Tarren Mill, then Arathi from west to east and
# back south-west to the Thandol Span for the Badlands. The first Arathi visit (Hammerfall's
# early chain, the Witherbark trolls) is in forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills.
#
# Flow: Orgrimmar (where the previous guide ends) -> zeppelin to the Undercity (training) ->
# fly to Tarren Mill -> Strahnbrad (Gol'dir) -> Tarren Mill -> the Perenolde manor -> the
# Dalaran ruins -> Tarren Mill -> east into Arathi: the Syndicate at Northfold, the Shards of
# Myzrael -> Hammerfall -> Drywhisker Gorge and the Iridescent Shards -> the eastern circle ->
# Boulderfist Hall, the Fleshstalkers and Go'shek Farm -> Hammerfall -> the outer and western
# circles -> the inner circle -> Faldir's Cove, from where the next guide crosses the Thandol
# Span into the Wetlands.
#
# Class training: the Undercity at the start for Warriors, Paladins, Rogues, Priests, Mages
# and Warlocks (Hunters, Shamans and Druids trained on the way to Orgrimmar).
#
# Carried on: Trollbane (638) from Stranglethorn; Foul Magics (671) from the first Arathi
# visit; Martek the Exiled (1106) and Sunken Treasure (669) for later on the route.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Undercity

step Zeppelin to Undercity
  zone Durotar
  goto 50.8,13.5 "Zeppelin to Undercity"

step Undercity trainers
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Undercity
  tip Train while you are in the Undercity: the trainers stand in the War Quarter, the Rogues' Quarter and the Magic Quarter (Paladins: Garen Largo).
  train class

step Fly to Tarren Mill
  zone Undercity
  goto 63.1,48.3 "Undercity flight master"
  fly "Tarren Mill"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tarren Mill and Alterac

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  accept 503                          -- Krusk, inside the inn
  accept 566                          -- The WANTED poster by the inn
  sethome "Tarren Mill"

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  goto 61.8,43.0 "Gol'dir"

step Gol'dir
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Head north past Valik's camp to Strahnbrad, the Syndicate-held village (35-37). Jailor Borhuin carries the Rusted Iron Key; Gol'dir sits in a cage in the house on the north side.
  tip Careful: Stealthed Syndicate spies roam Strahnbrad, and the buildings hold many Syndicate mobs, mages among them.
  collect 3704 quest 503.1            -- Inside
  complete 503 @60.6,43.8 map 1416    -- Find where Gol'dir is held, on the top floor
  turnin 503                          -- Gol'dir, on the top floor
  accept 506

step Hillsbrad Foothills
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 61.5,20.9 "Tarren Mill"

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Krusk waits inside the inn at Tarren Mill, back south down the road.
  turnin 506                          -- Krusk, inside
  accept 507

step Baron Vardus
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Baron Vardus (40) carries the head. He turns up in one spot at a time: the cellar of Strahnbrad's inn, or one of the Syndicate tent camps in the uplands north and north-west of the village, which lie on your way to the Perenolde manor. If you already met him while freeing Gol'dir, this step is done.
  collect 3626 quest 566              -- Head of Baron Vardus

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  goto 39.3,14.6 "Perenolde manor"

step Lord Aliden Perenolde
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Head north-west through the mountains to the Perenolde manor on the northern shore of Lordamere Lake. Lord Aliden Perenolde (41) waits in a room upstairs: he shields himself, puts you to sleep and heals below half health. Elysa stands beside him.
  kill 2423 quest 507.1 @39.3,14.6 map 1416
  turnin 507                          -- Elysa
  accept 508

step Old Dalaran Ruins: kill these as you meet them
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip South along the lake shore to the ruins around the Dalaran crater. The Dalaran Summoners lead Elemental Slaves; the bracers drop from the slaves.
  kill 2359 quest 545.2 @22.4,58.6 map 1416
  collect 3715 quest 557.1 @21.6,61.9 map 1416
  kill 2358 quest 545.1 @22.0,57.9 map 1416

step Hillsbrad Foothills
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 61.5,20.9 "Tarren Mill"

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Head back east to Tarren Mill.
  turnin 557                          -- Keeper Bel'varil, inside
  turnin 545                          -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare, inside
  note The magus offers a dungeon errand next: leave it.
  turnin 508                          -- Krusk, inside the inn
  turnin 566                          -- High Executor Darthalia

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Into Arathi

step Thoradin's Wall
  zone Arathi Highlands
  goto 32.6,40.4 "The road east through Thoradin's Wall"

step Northfold Manor
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Head east out of Tarren Mill through Thoradin's Wall. The Syndicate hold the walled manor and its farm north of the road; their Highwaymen, Mercenaries and Pathstalkers carry the Bloodstone Amulets.
  tip Careful: Highwaymen (level 30-31) can be in Sneak, so they may be hidden when you approach.
  collect 4495 quest 671

step The Shards of Myzrael
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Follow the road east. The violet shards glow just off the road a short way west of Hammerfall.
  turnin 635 optional
  accept 642

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Hammerfall

step Hammerfall
  zone Arathi Highlands
  turnin 638                          -- Zengu
  accept 678                          -- Drum Fel
  turnin 671                          -- Tor'gan
  accept 701
  accept 92519                        -- Doctor Gregory Victor, at the south gate

step Stromgarde quests for a group
  when group 639
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Zengu's Sigil of Strom drops from the elite Syndicate (35-38) in Stromgarde's ruins, the west of the highlands. Great XP if you have a group for it: the route passes Stromgarde on its way to the inner circle.
  accept 639                          -- Zengu

step Foul Magics with a group
  when group 673
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Tor'gan's next Foul Magics is Marez Cowl, a level 40 elite warlock in Stromgarde's Syndicate quarter.
  accept 673                          -- Tor'gan

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East of Hammerfall

step Drywhisker Gorge
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip North-east of Hammerfall the Drywhisker kobolds mine the gorge; the Kobolds at the mouth and the Diggers and Surveyors deeper in all drop the Motes of Myzrael.
  tip Careful: Every kobold type runs off for help when low on health (Kobolds at 30%, Surveyors and Diggers at 15%), which can pull more of them.
  collect 4435 quest 642

step Iridescent Shards
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Iridescent Shards lie at the far end of the gorge.
  turnin 642                          -- Below ground
  accept 651

step The Stone of East Binding
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Each Circle of Binding is a ring of standing stones; the key sits on the stone at its heart. The eastern circle is on the hills north-west of Hammerfall.
  tip Careful: Each center stone is guarded by around three elementals near level 39 that attack together if you click the stone without clearing them: Burning Exiles at West, Thundering Exiles at Outer, Cresting Exiles at East.
  collect 4484 quest 651              -- Cresting Key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South of Hammerfall

step Boulderfist Hall
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Boulderfist Brutes camp outside the ogres' hall, far south-west of Hammerfall; the Magus stand among them. Pull them one at a time.
  kill 2566 quest 678.1
  kill 2567 quest 678.2

step Fleshstalker raptors
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Highland Fleshstalkers (36-37) hunt the southern highlands, a pack north of Boulderfist Hall and another on the plain to its west. Pull them one at a time.
  collect 4513 quest 701

step Go'shek Farm
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Apothecary Jorell's lab shack stands at Go'shek Farm, north-east of the raptors' plain on the way back to Hammerfall; the case of Packaged Tonics is inside.
  collect 278462 quest 92519 @60.1,59.3 map 1417 -- Packaged Tonics

step Back to Hammerfall
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Back north-east to Hammerfall.
  turnin 92519                        -- Doctor Gregory Victor, at the south gate
  turnin 701                          -- Tor'gan
  accept 702
  turnin 678                          -- Drum Fel

step Boulderfist quests for a group
  when group 679
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Drum Fel's next Call to Arms and Korin Fel's The Real Threat are the elite ogres (38-40) in Stromgarde's ogre quarter, on the same group trip as the Sigil.
  accept 679                          -- Drum Fel
  accept 680                          -- Korin Fel, beside him
  turnin 702                          -- Gor'mul
  accept 847
  turnin 847                          -- Tor'gan
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The circles

step The Stone of Outer Binding
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Head west; the outer circle stands in the middle of the highlands.
  collect 4485 quest 651              -- Thundering Key

step Circle of West Binding
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The western circle is near Thoradin's Wall, north-west of the outer one.
  collect 4483 quest 651              -- Burning Key

step The Stone of Inner Binding
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The inner circle lies south of the western circle, east of Stromgarde.
  turnin 651
  note The stone's next task needs Fozruk, a level 42 elite who roams west of Hammerfall: leave it.

step Stromgarde
  when onquest 639,673,679,680
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip West of the inner circle, Stromgarde's ruins: the Syndicate hold the east half (the Sigil drops from their Conjurors, Prowlers and Magi; Marez Cowl is among them), the Boulderfist the west half by the Tower of Arathor (Or'Kalar waits in one of the roofless houses beside it).
  collect 4440 quest 639 @27.3,63.8 map 1417
  collect 4510 quest 673 @29.6,63.6 map 1417
  kill 2570 quest 679.1 @20.0,67.4 map 1417
  kill 2571 quest 679.2 @19.0,67.8 map 1417
  collect 4551 quest 680 @19.5,67.2 map 1417

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Faldir's Cove

step Faldir's Cove
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Head south to the goblins' cove on the southern coast. Lolo the Lookout keeps watch on the cliff above it.
  accept 663                          -- Lolo the Lookout
  turnin 663                          -- Shakes O'Breen
  accept 662                          -- First Mate Nilzlix
  accept 664                          -- Captain Steelgut
  accept 665                          -- Professor Phizzlethorpe

step Professor Phizzlethorpe
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Escort the professor up the hill to the cave above the cove and guard him while he works. Two level 40 water elementals ambush him there, and they are immune to frost. Hold them at the cave mouth, away from him: if the fight happens inside the cave, he joins in instead of working and more elementals keep coming.
  goto 33.9,80.6
  complete 665

step Doctor Draxlegauge
  zone Arathi Highlands
  turnin 665
  accept 666

step The Drowned Reef: kill these as you meet them
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip West of the cove the Daggerspine Raiders and Sorceresses (38-40) hold the shore: pull them one at a time. The two wrecks lie in the shallows off it, the charts and logs inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around the wrecks.
  kill 2595 quest 664.1               -- Underwater
  collect 4492 quest 666              -- Underwater
  kill 2596 quest 664.2               -- Underwater
  collect 4489 quest 662.2            -- Underwater
  collect 4487 quest 662.1            -- Underwater
